{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the darkness. Become one with the night. Feast on blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Dragos. A survivor of a vampire attack, turned into a creature of the night. You have to find your place in a world where vampires are at the top of the food chain. Torn between the urge to satisfy your hunger for blood and your responsibility towards the people you swore to protect in the fictitious Balkan area of Sangavia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the secret of the twisted history of Sangavias past. Build and customize a castle to extend your influence and to further your character\u2019s abilities. Experience a cinematic story confronting you with gut-wrenching decisions that will decide the fate of Sangavia forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/52c8ae766f052542b5d1f7ea20e6d0fc.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.poster.avif?t=1763539745\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.webm?t=1763539745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a huge open world, where the diverse mountain ranges, forests, dungeons, swamps and other areas are filled with discoveries as well as dangers. Treacherous enemies await, but all who are daring enough to tempt fate and explore their surroundings, will be rewarded handsomely.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/13b6fed024a73435b354c970a36aa750.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/57388e0051ab58c68e1871c8d089098d.poster.avif?t=1763539745\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/57388e0051ab58c68e1871c8d089098d.webm?t=1763539745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan, build and customize a beautiful medieval or gothic inspired multi-level castles with imposing watchtowers. You have dozens of wall pieces, roofs, floors, staircases, decor and furniture available to create the castle of your dreams - or nightmares. All fully customizable, so your creation can rival the home of Count Dracula. And don\u2019t forget your coffin. So you can Rest In Piece In Style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d9bc31376b7d61575c7a657bb88786df.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.poster.avif?t=1763539745\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.webm?t=1763539745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide, who lives, who dies and who will be your eternal follower. Do you succumb to the blood thirst and become a tyrant or will you try to serve the people you swore to protect and become a benevolent ruler? Explore the strengths and weaknesses of your votaries to ensure that only the most skilled join your vampire family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d46d7611217dc93fa71226e637cf79eb.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/9ceb2c8e71f325e45aae03234c330362.poster.avif?t=1763539745\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/9ceb2c8e71f325e45aae03234c330362.webm?t=1763539745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy being a vampire by leveraging superhuman strength, heightened perception, enhanced speed and more. With your new abilities you are able to see, hear and taste a world unreachable and unseen to mortal. You can even take control a bat and explore the vast open world flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/3bda3edd606f9ab4b6d04cfff0cc636a.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cinematic story with dramatic twists and turns, based on your decisions. Strike fear into the heart of your enemies. Protect the innocent. The fate of Sangavia is in your hands, and your hands alone. Depending on your choices not only the people\u2019s perception will change but you can unlock a wide variety of possible main story endings, before you venture into the open world to uncover every secret and every side mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d238d1e85359435c14b830a6c5270d0d.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Child of the Night, you don\u2019t have to be alone. Invite your friends to rule the land as equals and see where your individual decisions lead you. Unleash your creativity when you build your castle together. Explore the grim, sinister and bloody Sangavia as a team and face the dangers waiting in the darkness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2191500?t=1763539745","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763539745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/565d0af1083bc11272b58fbbaaa47173772c4cdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763539745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/565d0af1083bc11272b58fbbaaa47173772c4cdf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763539745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the darkness. Become one with the night. Feast on blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Dragos. A survivor of a vampire attack, turned into a creature of the night. You have to find your place in a world where vampires are at the top of the food chain. Torn between the urge to satisfy your hunger for blood and your responsibility towards the people you swore to protect in the fictitious Balkan area of Sangavia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the secret of the twisted history of Sangavias past. Build and customize a castle to extend your influence and to further your character\u2019s abilities. Experience a cinematic story confronting you with gut-wrenching decisions that will decide the fate of Sangavia forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/52c8ae766f052542b5d1f7ea20e6d0fc.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.poster.avif?t=1763539745\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.webm?t=1763539745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a huge open world, where the diverse mountain ranges, forests, dungeons, swamps and other areas are filled with discoveries as well as dangers. Treacherous enemies await, but all who are daring enough to tempt fate and explore their surroundings, will be rewarded handsomely.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img