not only the people\u2019s perception will change but you can unlock a wide variety of possible main story endings, before you venture into the open world to uncover every secret and every side mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d238d1e85359435c14b830a6c5270d0d.avif?t=1763539745\" width=900 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Child of the Night, you don\u2019t have to be alone. Invite your friends to rule the land as equals and see where your individual decisions lead you. Unleash your creativity when you build your castle together. Explore the grim, sinister and bloody Sangavia as a team and face the dangers waiting in the darkness.</p>","developers":["Mehuman Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/header.jpg?t=1763539745","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Vampires: Bloodlord Rising \u00a92025 Toplitz Productions GmbH. Published by Toplitz Productions. Developed by Mehuman Games S.A. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2191500/1805846053/7bf31754b01eecef06efa18f58d570052c4e5f43/1761832437/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761833672","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2191500/1805846053/7bf31754b01eecef06efa18f58d570052c4e5f43/1761832437/